on of Vīreśvara Mahā-\nḍakara, pupil of Advaitānanda Yati:\n Ārāmādipratiṣṭhāpaddhati. Hall p. 94.\n Gaṅgāstotra. Hall p. 94.\n Tarkacandrikā.\n Tirthakāśikā. Hall p. 94.\n Taittirīyakasārārthacandrikā. Hall p. 94.\n Dhyānavallarī. L. 1243. K. 122.\n Nāmakaumudī. L. 2110.\n Nārāyaṇatattvavāda. Hall p. 94.\n Prapañcasāraviveka. K. 186. Poona 165.\n Bhāvasāraviveka. Hall p. 94.\n Maṇikarṇikāstotra. Printed in Häberlin p. 475.\n Mantravallarī Mantramahodadhiṭīkā. L. 2776.\n Rāmastuti. Hall p. 94.\n Viṣṇusahasranāman, composed in 1762. K. 206.\n Śārīrakasūtrasārārthacandrikā or Subodhinī. IO.\n600. Hall p. 94. K. 136. SB. 416.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर Prayogapaddhati. read B. 1, 232.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर Viśveśvarastutipārijāta. read Oudh 1876, 28.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर Saṃgītasetu. This is in Hindi.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर Smṛticintāmaṇi. He was a son of Gopīnātha.\n[]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर son of Govardhana: read Varṣaphalapaddhati\ninstead of Varṣaphalatantra", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर son of Rāma: Saṃskārapaddhati. read BP.\n301.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर son of Sadāśiva: Maṇikarṇikāstotra. read p. 471.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर See Kākoji.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर father of Dāmodara (Yantracintāmaṇi).\n[]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर father of Lakṣmaṇa Kavi (Yuddhakāṇḍa in\nCampūrāmāyaṇa).", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर brother of Mahīdhara, son of Manoratha, son\nof Cakrapāṇi, son of Dāmodara, composed an in-\nscription in 1137/38. He wrote an Advaitaśataka.\nEpigraphia Indica II, 330.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Grahabhāvaprakāśaṭīkā. Peters. 4, 36. Stein 158\n(Gadādhara).", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Candravilāsa nāṭaka.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Tarkabhāṣāṭīkā.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Nṛsiṃhacaritasudhā.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Yogasāra med.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर younger brother of Viṣṇu and Lakṣmīdhara,\nson of Govardhana:\n Gaṇitāmṛtasāgarī Līlāvatīṭīkā.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर son of Bhairava Daivajña, grandson of Kṛṣṇa:\n Muhūrtālaṃkāra, composed in 1632.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर son of Sadāśiva, grandson of Vīreśvara Mahā-\nḍakara:\n Pañcīkaraṇacandrikā.\n Prapañcasāraviveka or Bhavasāraviveka\n.--Bhā-\nvasāraviveka to be omitted.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर son of Rāmacandra, father of Rāmakṛṣṇa.\nGaṅgādhara wrote a bhāṣya on Kātyāyana's Śulba-\nsūtra, and this was completed by his son Rāma-\nkṛṣṇa. Ulwar Extr. 47.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर son of Vidhicandra, wrote in 1686:\n Bhāsvatīkaraṇodāharaṇa.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Laghusaundaryalaharī.\n[]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर son of Deveśvara, pupil of Milhaṇa, the author\nof Cikitsāmṛta.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाधर son of Bhairava Daivajña:\n Tājikaratna.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गंगाधर", "गङ्गाधरः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["gaMgADara", "gaNgADaraH"]}], "gaNgadevistotra": [{"id": "gaNgAdevIstotra", "headword": "गङ्गादेवीस्तोत्र", "headword_slp1": "gaNgAdevIstotra", "fold": "gaNgadevistotra", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "गङ्गादेवीस्तोत्र a poem in praise of Gaṅgādevī, the\ndaughter of Nityānanda, by Abhirāma Gosvāmin.\nL. 1623. Compare Gaṅgāṣṭaka.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gaNgadvaramahatmya": [{"id": "gaNgAdvAramAhAtmya", "headword": "गङ्गाद्वारमाहात्म्य", "headword_slp1": "gaNgAdvAramAhAtmya", "fold": "gaNgadvaramahatmya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "गङ्गाद्वारमाहात्म्य from Kedārakhaṇḍa of Skandapurāṇa.\nIndex Oxf. 84^b.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गङ्गाद्वारमाहात्म्य See Māy